th entrance.","evidence_claim":"Historic Huguenot Street describes the 1799 LeFevre House as having a massive brick façade and identifies it as an early Federal-style building.","source_url":"https://www.huguenotstreet.org/lefevre-donations","source_title":"Help Preserve the 1799 LeFevre House — Historic Huguenot Street","source_kind":"cultural_institution","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Exterior viewing is available from the historic corridor; preservation work may affect close access.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"huguenot-street-jean-hasbrouck-memorial-house","subject_type":"street_or_district","entity_name":"Jean Hasbrouck Memorial House","title":"Jean Hasbrouck Memorial House","subtitle":"Huguenot Street corridor","notes":"Use this named memorial house as a waypoint opposite Deyo House and read its place in the organization’s preserved patentee-property landscape.","short_summary":"A named memorial house opposite the Deyo House.","evidence_claim":"Historic Huguenot Street identifies the Jean Hasbrouck House as the Memorial House opposite Deyo House and says the organization safeguards patentee property along Huguenot Street.","source_url":"https://www.huguenotstreet.org/deyo","source_title":"Deyo Family Association — Historic Huguenot Street","source_kind":"cultural_institution","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"View as part of the public historic-street walk; follow posted museum and property boundaries.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"huguenot-street-jacob-hasbrouck-house","subject_type":"street_or_district","entity_name":"Jacob Hasbrouck House","title":"Jacob Hasbrouck House","subtitle":"Huguenot Street corridor","notes":"Add the Jacob Hasbrouck House to a guided-route plan; it is specifically included in the site’s i